Suggests: gpsd, gpsd-clients, python3-venv
Description: geofenced Repeat/Monitor control for an OpenHop MeshCore repeater
 Switches an OpenHop MeshCore repeater between Repeat (forward) and Monitor
 (or no_tx) based on configured GPS zones and optional MeshMapper coverage.
 Includes hysteresis, a safe mode latch, an optional web interface with a
 map, and an optional MeshCore companion for reports and commands.
 .
 A fresh installation provides one-time browser setup for the administrator
 password.
